sequenceDiagram
  participant E as Visual or Source editor
  participant C as clipboard
  participant L as languages
  E->>C: paste
  C->>L: providers with a matching pasteMimeTypes
  L-->>C: edits, each resolved
  Note over C: sortPasteEdits
  C->>E: the first edit goes in
  Note over E: "Paste as" chip: the others
